<main class="page page-with-tabs">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1 class="brand">今日なに着てく？</h1>
  </header>

  <p class="notify-status">
    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"></path><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"></path></svg>
    毎朝 7:00 に今日の天気とおすすめの服装を LINE でお届け中！
  </p>

  <section class="weather-card" aria-label="マイエリアの今日の天気と服装">
    <% if @error %>
      <p class="weather-error"><%= @error %></p>
    <% else %>
      <%# 今日のアドバイス（LINE で届いたものと同じ）を、トップと同じ天気カードで出す。服装の下は AI の一言 %>
      <%= render "shared/weather_card",
                 place_name: "🏠 #{@location.name}", date: @advice.date,
                 max_temp: @advice.max_temp, min_temp: @advice.min_temp,
                 yesterday_max_temp: @advice.yesterday_max_temp,
                 precipitation_probability: @advice.precipitation_probability,
                 outfit: @advice.outfit_level, judgment: @judgment,
                 comment: @advice.home_comment,
                 show_line_invite: false %>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <section class="friend-card" aria-label="LINE の友だち追加">
    <%= image_tag "kyonanichan.png", alt: "今日なにちゃん", class: "friend-card-character", width: 150, height: 150 %>
    <div class="friend-card-body">
      <p class="friend-card-text">友だち追加すると、今日なにちゃんが毎日天気とおすすめの服装をお知らせしてくれます！</p>
      <%= link_to "LINE で友だち追加", Rails.configuration.x.line_friend_url, class: "friend-card-button", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%= render "shared/tab_bar", current: :home %>
</main>
